Now my elder brother, Diego, comes onto the screen.
He sits next to Sofia.
Diego smiles and looks at me.
"Maya, how is your new job?" he asks.
"My job is very nice," I tell him.
"My office is very big."
"How are the people there?" Diego asks.
"The people there are very nice," I say.
"Who is your friend in the office?" he asks.
"I have one friend there," I say.
"His name is Rohan."
"He is my colleague."
"He helps me a lot," I say happily.
"Is Rohan an engineer?" Sofia asks.
"Yes, he is a software engineer," I tell her.
Diego and Sofia look very happy.
I like my new work.
And I like my office too.
